                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5548355a-2ba3-325b-8b68-2fae60bf34cd",
                        "entry_id": "d3bcdb48-7e9f-3a14-a516-55457bb4db2a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iemand met een grillige en chagrijnige stemming of karakter"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "162f2897-0a17-4fdf-8c40-46c65d5d7e96",
                                "sense_id": "5548355a-2ba3-325b-8b68-2fae60bf34cd",
                                "text": "Het nukkige meisje trok een pruilmondje en stampte met haar voeten op de grond."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95506667-df25-4215-824d-805ae7b8c3aa",
                                "sense_id": "5548355a-2ba3-325b-8b68-2fae60bf34cd",
                                "text": "Het nukkige kind deed expres alles verkeerd."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e5f70ee-78ad-4adc-8d23-9bc0f542399d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3bcdb48-7e9f-3a14-a516-55457bb4db2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5548355a-2ba3-325b-8b68-2fae60bf34cd",
                        "target_lang_word": "capricious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "capricious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                        "entry_id": "523a41c1-9ed8-3f1f-bd74-d5473cd1db43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impulsive and unpredictable; determined by chance, impulse, or whim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f547e6ac-619c-4ad1-9e0f-5db1a65fcc5c",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "I almost died in a capricious winter storm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18399f7f-61a1-4504-86f4-011a25d88e85",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "Stringent rulers are unlikely to act capriciously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91f79306-c73b-46e1-898f-a78553365dad",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "I am heere with thee, and thy Goats, as the moſt capricious Poet honeſt Ouid was among Gothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0abd0bf3-5b3c-41d5-be6a-66cc5683db76",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "\"Capricious?\" And at this monsieur began to laugh. \"Oh no, I'm not capricious. I am very faithful. I am very constant. Comprenez?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a509b2c-e74b-4b24-9973-e28bc94120de",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "Although much has been learned about lightning and its effects through research and study, many questions are still unanswered and the upper limits of voltage, current and total energy that may be associated with lightning are not conclusively defined. The apparent capricious nature of lightning is evidenced by the range of extremes as well as, in some cases, the unique nature of the damage that results. Thus, to predict in the absence of physical evidence the exact mechanism of ignition in this particular case is not possible. By the same reasoning, in view of the known facts of this accident, there is no logical explanation for ignition of the flammable vapors other than some effect stemming directly from the lightning strike."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f2627abd-23a5-4731-b581-d87ac37af2e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3bcdb48-7e9f-3a14-a516-55457bb4db2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5548355a-2ba3-325b-8b68-2fae60bf34cd",
                        "target_lang_word": "fitful",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fitful",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9aa4cbb-edad-3bdf-bee0-518cfa26e3d5",
                                        "entry_id": "8ff79551-5967-35d6-8681-afba20ce8599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by fits (convulsions or seizures)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6287b07a-4b8a-49a0-99ac-bedcd1574046",
                                                "sense_id": "f9aa4cbb-edad-3bdf-bee0-518cfa26e3d5",
                                                "text": "Duncane is in his Graue:\n After Lifes fitfull Feuer, he ſleepes well,\n Treaſon ha's done his worſt: not Steele, not Poyſon,\n Mallice domeſtique, forraine Leuie, nothing,\n Can touch him further."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                        "entry_id": "8ff79551-5967-35d6-8681-afba20ce8599",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by sudden bursts of activity with periods of inactivity in between; intermittent, irregular, unsteady."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af13294e-46b4-482f-93dd-df232789ca96",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "His breathing was fitful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca3dc942-6977-42b7-bcbb-352d012af1b9",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "Troubled by her unfinished work, she fell into a fitful sleep."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c379b451-1da0-4408-a1ea-fa67b7154a35",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "Harp of the North! that mouldering long hast hung\n On the witch-elm that shades Saint Fillan's spring,\n And down the fitful breeze thy numbers flung,\n Till envious ivy did around thee cling,\n Muffling with verdant ringlet every string,— […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e20e3eb-a6b5-43eb-9856-fcdb8cc3fce7",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "Like the figures on arras, that gloomily glare\n Stirred by the breath of the wintry air,\n So seen by the dying lamp's fitful light,\n Lifeless, but life-like, and awful to sight; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20d61d97-5c77-4060-8dbf-0dbe120bfb58",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "The cabin lamp—taking long swings this way and that— was burning fitfully, and casting fitful shadows upon the old man’s bolted door,—a thin one, with fixed blinds inserted, in place of upper panels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c196f69-d57e-4cbf-b58c-02587558d7c2",
                                                "sense_id": "c986413c-b59a-3f5b-909b-0c6f6b90e39e",
                                                "text": "So fitful has Britain’s economy been that any good news is understandably snatched at."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
